{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10267","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得君字 · 邬载","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得君字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"策名十二载，独立先斯文。\n迩来及门者，半已昇青云。\n青云岂无姿，黄鹄素不羣。\n一辞芸香吏，几岁沧江濆。\n散职既不羁，天听亦昭闻。\n虽承急贤诏，未谒陶唐君。\n薄俸还自急，此言那足云。\n和风媚东郊，时物滋南薰。\n蕙草正可摘，豫章犹未分。\n宗师忽千里，使我心氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邬载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}